  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference platform for automated cell phenotyping — BSD-3-Clause, 1.1k stars, v4.2.8 September 2024, maintained by the Broad Institute. Modular pipeline design makes it accessible to biologists without programming expertise while supporting headless batch processing for high-throughput screening. Widely cited across drug discovery and cell biology research. Adopt for teams performing automated quantitative cell analysis from fluorescence or brightfield microscopy.",
